<title>USA: Celebrity to exit underperforming areas.</title>
<headline>Celebrity to exit underperforming areas.</headline>
<dateline>TYLER, Texas 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celebrity Inc said on Monday that it would exit underperforming areas of business such as cotton goods.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to operate profitably at a level of annual sales of $120 million, which is well below its sales plan for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>Its order book and shipments to date may exceed last year's first quarter sales of $35.9 millon, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
